    "droppedClaims": [
      {
        "text": "claim text",
        "reason": "why excluded (missing citation / ambiguous entity / speculative)"
      }
    ]
  }
}

Output constraints:
- Keep `confidence` in [0,1].
- Keep `citationCount` consistent with `citationIds`.
- `verified` must be true only when citation support is present and relevant.
- If no reliable facts are present, return empty arrays and coverage with zeros.
